      "options": {
        "content": "# SLO Policy\n\nNormative contract: `docs/observability/slo-error-budget-policy.md`.\n\n**Window:** 30-day rolling. **Burn:** error ratio / (1 - target). Fast page at 14.4x on 1h **and** 5m. Slow ticket at 6x on 6h **and** 30m. Freeze feature rollouts below 25% remaining budget; freeze all non-incident changes at 0%.\n\n**SLI:** terminal valid events only (`event=` on lifecycle counters; audit `outcome` in delivered/dead_letter/dropped). Start, retry, rejected, conflict, and canceled are excluded.\n\nLatency p99 panels on other dashboards are diagnostic until histogram buckets include SLO thresholds.",
